{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/fc9g03obvx78425w2fg14h9sc21xxq1.mp3","text":"让我看看博士的抽屉里都藏了点什么好东西。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/5aiiaofe1y420v0lp2ef41t3795m35v.mp3","text":"我现在大概只有爸爸一条腿那么大吧，以后我也要变那么大，然后撞翻所有的坏人！哇嗷！！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/0bju8pcev05yoow01bcw9vyb1az8dq3.mp3","text":"对不起我错了，下次再也不在走廊里乱跑了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/2ver3qops0h3u8kktwxs55eoezdb31j.mp3","text":"打架超简单的啦，盾往那里一竖，就没人能打过我了。啊绕到我背后就行？对哦，我怎么没想到呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/5xw4hfvl3jjdo1mo46i9x8kth4i09da.mp3","text":"嘉维尔？没听说过，很强吗，在萨尔贡很有名吗？哎呀别说了，厉害不厉害我看看就知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/hxo1lddsoppr62m5la69kvtafihb6cy.mp3","text":"哦，你是说嘉维尔姐姐吗，哎呀我可是嘉维尔姐姐的头号粉丝，看到我盾牌里那个签名了吗，是亲笔签名哦！我觉得吧，除了老爹，估计也没几个人能打过嘉维尔姐姐了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/fm471qs2jm5iws4sjk08mv0fm8mlvgo.mp3","text":"博士你悄悄告诉我，小刻的火神大姐能不能一锤砸穿这层楼？不会吗？我就知道是这样，那还是我爸爸比较厉害，一拳就能打碎罗德岛的大烟囱。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/05/n29wdx6arbyjsfs3drrruym85xx812l.mp3","text":"真的......还要在这本本子上加一笔吗......好吧......“今天，泡泡撞翻了Lancet-2小姐，泡泡下次不会这样做了。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/aglivkgb3cvu5shicawnn29q2xfnfaj.mp3","text":"这是我的盾牌，以后会是我的腿甲，说不定会变成我的肩甲哦，到那时候，我只要往你身后一站，嘿嘿，就没人敢欺负你啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/98zijxe8a6lz0jt2l1mxocf0kh40dk9.mp3","text":"博士，起来呀，门口好像有人找你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/6thflx4v9xi6c9meiioom35q7mpp5zk.mp3","text":"你就是训练营的老大吗，你叫博士吗？嗯......但你看起来不壮啊......算了，我叫泡泡，是部落里最弱的，你要负责把我训练成第二强的哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/blb2fj2beiiehwty8qzh1q6u7jo4eg1.mp3","text":"打，继续打，哎怎么停了，结束了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/e27hz07nr949qqc41zlerwk4rsuoz21.mp3","text":"这是训练的奖励？哦好的。不能吃？唔......","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/8di1dd1khva967kqfevqksg2zaby5mh.mp3","text":"我觉得我能和小刻五五开了！好，我要和她大战一场，博士你来做见证！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/rc4222nb8oc56kqd8cqtyml4f3md588.mp3","text":"听话？我试试看吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/or45c5vdcgnwyyi9xpyrxzikl7edoh6.mp3","text":"我们数到一就开始跑，好不好？","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/cxlksspumvnx4lbb0iqwyfwqu1pz2j0.mp3","text":"冲啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/tmdpk93wjthgbh3be78nv77k9ntpzer.mp3","text":"打架啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/6rpiie25866037cl8po4y993mn2vs6g.mp3","text":"选我啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/8pwjnlkbp5f76xan0vrp43xoc6fxb6p.mp3","text":"嘻嘻。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/4eeby7dff6eyq3i5ww2zx26u724gsre.mp3","text":"面对坏人！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/svfwtdhdm492x1ib113wj88thh7b6f5.mp3","text":"举盾！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/061d84xdigasixp5xfb5hmyh6do7hd2.mp3","text":"我撞！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/3eisutgdpeiavaodd30rkw10u7ke01n.mp3","text":"我拍！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/9jj4st5ebsheaab9sdic5vihvrj3x7j.mp3","text":"尖刺冲击！！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/4mjcq0k8jmrmp1bdcu8j8hc7bkp93ez.mp3","text":"咚！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/kpfk1hv0ai02w8vtzq4l68i5kkv84h4.mp3","text":"博士你要是够强壮，一定也是像我爸爸那样的勇士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/r8r84o6e21ogrb41a50xqbtu9ujwvv6.mp3","text":"我就说嘛，我超厉害的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/blxtgrugharbwpd27ac07anncs4hj39.mp3","text":"嗯，有人跑了？是我没挡住吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/0zkqp79361htfpc74p27o25p7hcegid.mp3","text":"打不过了！怎么办怎么办？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/2jv6sstp95nlhcabc49u9bw5ggz8le7.mp3","text":"再大点，再大点嘛，这么小怎么住人？","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/9ykz9mnl7dao5akax30hkobhb2i9cdb.mp3","text":"哎呀，有点痒。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/2c74feii5dag73tucekdk3hl43qn2ia.mp3","text":"博士，来捉迷藏！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/iw4pf1xjw5c8kpbw6mku8bi8uvile9t.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/0blhxco8u89c1z96cl5rer0fx5j122x.mp3","text":"新年！假期！没有作业！好，今天就去挑战小刻！博士，你也不要总是坐着啦，要不要来和我们一起玩对对碰的游戏？很有意思的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/ez5soeavp1a0b2unhd3yisjpl5c6jnz.mp3","text":"博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_381_bubble/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/t56nexe85n93q4ih3itmna1uqc7hf5s.mp3","text":"让我看看博士的抽屉里都藏了点什么好东西。","alt":"voice/char_381_bubble/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/bg1axjhwj6cvnsqfylzv91931rx279z.mp3","text":"我现在大概只有爸爸一条腿那么大吧，以后我也要变那么大，然后撞翻所有的坏人！哇嗷！！","alt":"voice/char_381_bubble/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/m5fy7j6ypk8mvejh2nmnzntf5rgxcfk.mp3","text":"对不起我错了，下次再也不在走廊里乱跑了！","alt":"voice/char_381_bubble/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/dye1aobzjv1pc9i8janx0hwsk9lqz10.mp3","text":"打架超简单的啦，盾往那里一竖，就没人能打过我了。啊绕到我背后就行？对哦，我怎么没想到呢？","alt":"voice/char_381_bubble/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/q7xc6blr2ljb3jgtkom8deaeqgz3mpd.mp3","text":"嘉维尔？没听说过，很强吗，在萨尔贡很有名吗？哎呀别说了，厉害不厉害我看看就知道了。","alt":"voice/char_381_bubble/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/ontu34avuy4wuuixzn6vei2r083a73j.mp3","text":"哦，你是说嘉维尔姐姐吗，哎呀我可是嘉维尔姐姐的头号粉丝，看到我盾牌里那个签名了吗，是亲笔签名哦！我觉得吧，除了老爹，估计也没几个人能打过嘉维尔姐姐了。","alt":"voice/char_381_bubble/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/0hcgpssgj81qjbo0imc2ene4qvm2xks.mp3","text":"博士